node_modules/

# The repo root ignores `**/package-lock.json` and `.npmrc` (pnpm-only policy).
# This fixture is the documented npm carve-out — see the "Package manager" note
# in the root AGENTS.md — so both files are tracked here on purpose. The
# lockfile pins the third-party closure so install size and the zero-tolerance
# watchlist counts can't drift from upstream point releases.
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
